&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This lexicon is a living document that will be updated as new terminology emerges in the modular synthesizer community. Feel free to bookmark this page for quick reference while exploring the world of modular synthesis!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
